        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Great atmosphere and a staff that really cares and knows what they're doing. Simulator will occasionally not pick up a wedge shot if you hit it too perfectly and putting in a bit of a joke. Oh also it's adds about 25 yards or subtracts 25 yards from every club depending on if your swing speed is fast or not. Still great feedback from the sim and a great training tool to stay in shape for the summer.",
        "time": 1639691133,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
