        "text": "Friendly staff and very clean.",
        "time": 1734487318,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Susanne Butler",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111123998727693870234/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBmgQ66k_px2Sq6252Zuhtkzz9cjmhgTI-niGtbWPz1boDVbc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "This is a terrifically friendly place to play virtual golf. The atmosphere is clean and service is speedy. You can also eat and drink while playing and you never feel rushed. There is something for every age. We simply love golfing all winter in Canada. This is the best way I know to get exercise and keep your golf game sharp during the off season.",
        "time": 1524665787,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "George Toth",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105988643537892656154/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIDqFRdcEuB31jAnI-Yl4PqYxQ-lDmULsTTjG7oVJuvk1J4xw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 years ago",
        "text": "I love this place! I've been going there for three years and a regular member for the last two years. the simulators are great, and the atmosphere is assume.",
        "time": 1457447247,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
